<description>&lt;p&gt;María Corina Machado has returned to Venezuela, prompting protests demanding elections and her continued presence. The United States has deployed Space Force electromagnetic and electronic warfare systems against Venezuela and pressured Reliance to refine Venezuelan oil, while CIA Director Ratcliffe visited Havana with a paramilitary operative linked to a past operation that killed 32 Cuban soldiers. The Pentagon has barred DoD personnel from using nonpublic information to bet on U.S. military actions involving Venezuela, and the DOJ arrested a soldier who made $400,000 betting on Maduro's removal. UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOaG9BTkM1Y1AxZG1vRHp0QUo0aEJYVk9jWXhfSFFHdnVjQ2RScUVOR215RWtLQnkzcGZSOFY5Q1U0eEg2bG96czR1T29UWDRfSXR6M3U3aDVoN05BRzZtazBmaHF6a1Fod29CMmNyNlFlUGNTZ1YtRWI1dzF4cjZkT2ZTbFVpbnd0NkNabjl4R2lSdlJ4RUZIZjNsQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxONFF1c0VyUE5xMTJTTmIxdTZtcGVVRWtDdTVtZzJUay1yYXFEMjRoOHE4Qm5WbnlXbU1KNU1zb1lNUGhvRjR5REp6cGtySUNDR3hkbmJfeVhjeUtURkY1MmZfU1pnU3doMW9iMVJHYmpJTVk1ZHN5cllWVTRwMUloR3hNeFhuRVNnWks0cEtyYzkxaVl3UnpNRXJFV05nclJJa0dweWhCbjh1azF0X1hENjU5c3NWWlFt?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOVklXeGVrdE1SSWNyYjNDb2N5dGtKbWxYVGg0YUk3QUFlRjVad1dBQmhCV24zdXgtYldYcG5tcThjOXp6MGNkbzgzUjQ1NVVXbnRmQTl5d3FMRnJacnU0RUFPUEMzQ1VFMTBObGRacnMwY05vMm5HY0g3dmo1U1BHemtkZmNvU3Z0dE54OHZWSnE4aERrT3pIbkFYdHRIYi1vQ2gtTlNocnRBS0NhcnpwWkpadEpwTWVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQZHBOSnBjeUdCWUttMDJWbUJOMDV